@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100
@token = replace-with-local-access-token
@bomId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Preview BOM standard-cost rollup
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/boms/{{bomId}}/cost-rollup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve and apply the previewed rollup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/boms/{{bomId}}/cost-rollup/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedTotalCost": 260
}

### Reject an invalid negative cost
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/erp/boms/{{bomId}}/cost-rollup/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedTotalCost": -1
}
